  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "GE01110",
    "sub_id": "57554",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>評量方式 動作 In the class 實地授課: Midterm Exam 期中考: 30% Final Exam 期末考: 30% TA Session 實習課: 20% Class Participation 課堂參與 (based on Attendance &amp; Bonus 根據出席率與課堂加分): 20% Online 實時線上授課: Midterm Exam Online 實時線上期中考: 30% Final Exam Online 實時線上期末考: 30% TA Session Online 實時線上實習課: 20% Class Participation Online 實時線上課堂參與 (based on Attendance Online &amp; Bonus 根據實時線上點名與課堂加分): 20%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1.上課請準時出席，勿遲到早退或缺曠課。若有個人因素須請假，請依學校程序完成事假、病假或公假等請假手續。\n2.為尊重智慧財產權，教科書原文或中譯本請自行購買或借閱正版教科書，勿影印教科書。\n3.上課老師提供之自製PPT請自行下載或列印，但請勿外流提供非修課同學使用。",
    "course_pol_en": "Please attend classes on time and avoid arriving late, leaving early, or skipping classes. If you need to be absent due to personal reasons, please follow the school's procedures for requesting leave, whether it's personal leave, sick leave, or other official leave.\nTo respect intellectual property rights, please purchase or borrow original textbooks or authorized translations. Avoid photocopying textbooks.\nPlease download or print the teacher-provided custom PowerPoint presentations for class use only. Do not distribute or share them with students who are not enrolled in the course.",
    "course_rem": "1.為增加課程理解專業能力，可事先預習，或按時課後複習。\n2.為鼓勵同學課堂參與，上課參與發言回答問題，會於期末時額外加分。\n3.缺曠過多者會影響學期成績，請同學留意。",
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>報告內容請依學術論文格式引註參考資料，勿抄襲或翻譯他人文章或陳述。</div>\n\n<div>課堂作業、測驗或報告請自行完成，勿參考或抄襲他人答案或作品，尊重他人智慧成果。</div>\n",
